        "raw": "[quote=\"ras906\"]\nI'm sure this is answered somewhere else but if there is 1 badland in an area and you do 1 damage to 2 different towns in that area, does the badland do 1 more damage to each town and destroy both towns?\n[/quote]\nTo amplify what Paul said, you would end up destroying 1 Town and leaving the other with 1 damage.\n\nEach Badlands does 1 extra damage per \"Action\", which is a term that will be carefully defined in the Jagged Earth rules; this includes one Spirit Power, for instance.\n",
